silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_01_gate_discipline_sections_01_source_witness_ingestion_concrete_anchor_2 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 01_source_witness_ingestion #2', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'Source-Witness Ingestion' the bare symbol CitedInfoObject anchors to MittensBodyMassLocalInfo: The interpreted claim extracted from the vet record: 'Mittens has a body mass of 4.2 kg recorded by Dr. Osei on 2024-03-15.' This is the paraphrase stripped of formatting artifacts; it states the Forge-relevant fact.." .
